<title>POLAND: American UCI to open multiplex in Poland in 1998.</title>
<headline>American UCI to open multiplex in Poland in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Cinemas International (UCI), a joint venture between Paramount and Universal, plans to open its first high-tech multiplex cinema in March next year in the Polish city of Poznan, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The project is part of the firm's $100 million investment programme to build, under the name of Multikino Ltd, 10 multiplexes in Poland over the next two years, it said.</p>
<p>Multikino is a joint venture between UCI and Polish media group ITI.</p>
<p>ITI, linked with McCann Erickson Advertiisng since 1991, is one of Poland's largest advertising service companies, specialising in TV, film, and advertisement studio production.</p>
<p>-- Pawel Kozlowski +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
